wordings.plain:
I want to send {who} a podcast episode we can talk about. About them:
- What they listen to: {listens_to}
- What they bring up at dinner: {dinner}
- What they've already heard every argument about: {already_heard}
- Where and how they'll listen: {situation}
- How long: {length}
- How hard it should push: {push}
- Who should be the expert: {expert}

Suggest 3 or 4 specific episodes (not shows). Put each on one line in this form:
Show — Episode title | length | clean or explicit | suggested timestamp for my comment | link
Use an Apple Podcasts episode link when you can. For a Substack, give the post link. One link per line, nothing else on the line after the link.

